44ZG10VHRwYUZGeGZVWTNsTW9NdVBjX0xpaWhTQ2g1djQxaE81a3lMMEp6MXJ3VQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-25","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":8},{"name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-05","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1535527/000153552726000010/crwd-20260131.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Founded in 2011, CrowdStrike reinvented cybersecurity for the cloud and artificial intelligence (\"AI\") era and transformed the way cybersecurity is delivered and experienced by customers. When we started CrowdStrike, cyberattackers had an asymmetric advantage over legacy cybersecurity products that could not keep pace with rapid changes in adversary tactics, a dynamic that has intensified as adversaries increasingly leverage automation, identity abuse, and AI to operate at machine speed.","zh":"CrowdStrike 成立於 2011 年，重塑了雲端和人工智慧 (“AI”) 時代的網路安全，並改變了客戶提供和體驗網路安全的方式。當我們啟動 CrowdStrike 時，網路攻擊者相對於傳統網路安全產品具有不對稱優勢，這些產品無法跟上對手戰術的快速變化，隨著對手越來越多地利用自動化、身份濫用和人工智慧以機器速度運行，這種動態不斷加劇。"},{"en":"We took a fundamentally different approach to solve this problem with the AI-native CrowdStrike Falcon cybersecurity platform, which serves as the operating system for cybersecurity. CrowdStrike built the first, true, cloud-native platform with AI at the core, capable of harnessing vast amounts of security and enterprise data to drive real-time security decisions and response – stopping breaches at scale through a single lightweight sensor.","zh":"我們採用了一種根本不同的方法來解決這個問題，即使用人工智慧原生的 CrowdStrike Falcon 網路安全平台，該平台充當網路安全的作業系統。 CrowdStrike 建立了第一個以 AI 為核心的真正的雲端原生平台，能夠利用大量安全性和企業資料來推動即時安全決策和回應 - 透過單一輕量級感測器阻止大規模違規行為。"},{"en":"The CrowdStrike Falcon platform is designed to be the definitive platform for cybersecurity consolidation, purpose-built to stop breaches. The platform's single, lightweight sensor collects and integrates data from across the enterprise, including endpoints, cloud workloads, identities, and third-party sources. This data is ingested once and reused across multiple security functions, forming the foundation for detection, investigation, and response across the platform. We use this to train our AI to detect and prevent threats and drive workflow automation to give security teams machine speed advantage to stop adversaries. By consolidating and replacing legacy point products and fragmented platforms across key areas of security and IT, the Falcon platform delivers a unified, modern approach that increases capabilities, reduces complexity, and lowers costs – all while stopping breaches.","zh":"CrowdStrike Falcon 平台旨在成為網路安全整合的權威平台，專門用於阻止違規行為。該平台的單一輕量級感測器收集並整合來自整個企業的數據，包括端點、雲端工作負載、身分和第三方來源。這些數據被提取一次並在多個安全功能中重複使用，形成跨平台檢測、調查和回應的基礎。我們用它來訓練我們的人工智慧來偵測和預防威脅，並驅動工作流程自動化，為安全團隊提供機器速度優勢來阻止對手。透過整合和替換跨安全性和 IT 關鍵領域的傳統單點產品和分散式平台，Falcon 平台提供了一種統一的現代化方法，可增強功能、降低複雜性並降低成本，同時阻止違規行為。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Some of the world's largest enterprises, government organizations, and high-profile brands trust us to protect their business. As of January 31, 2026, we are trusted by more than 88,000 organizations, including our end customers and those of our Managed Security Service Providers (\"MSSPs\"), worldwide. Historically, we and our channel partners have primarily sold to large organizations, but have increasingly focused on selling to small and medium-sized businesses, particularly through our trial-to-pay model. We engage our customers through our global customer and technical advisory boards in which we solicit feedback from our customers on a regular basis allowing us to understand their evolving needs. We have used this feedback to develop new cloud modules, such as Falcon FileVantage, and we intend to continue to develop new cloud modules based on our customer's feedback. Our business is ","zh":"一些世界上最大的企业、政府组织和知名品牌信任我们来保护他们的业务。截至 2026 年 1 月 31 日，我們受到全球超過 88,000 個組織的信任，包括我們的最終客戶和託管安全服務提供者 (“MSSP”) 的最終客戶。從歷史上看，我們和我們的通路合作夥伴主要向大型組織銷售，但越來越注重向中小型企業銷售，特別是透過我們的試用付費模式。我們透過全球客戶和技術諮詢委員會與客戶互動，定期徵求客戶的回饋意見，以便我們了解他們不斷變化的需求。我們已使用此回饋來開發新的雲端模組，例如 Falcon FileVantage，並且我們打算根據客戶的回饋繼續開發新的雲端模組。我們的業務是"},{"en":"Our sales and marketing organizations work together closely to drive market awareness, build a strong sales pipeline and cultivate customer relationships to drive revenue growth.","zh":""}],"competition":[{"en":"We primarily compete with established and emerging security product vendors. While the market for traditional endpoint and IT operations solutions has historically been intensely competitive, we believe that the architecture of our cloud-native, single sensor platform fundamentally differentiates us compared to both next-gen and legacy competitors in the security industry. Additionally, as we look to enter into adjacent markets and expand our total addressable market, we may face new competitors. However, we do not believe any of our competitors currently have a true platform offering equivalent to the Falcon platform, which can be leveraged to win in legacy markets and define new categories.","zh":"我們主要與成熟和新興的安全產品供應商競爭。雖然傳統端點和 IT 營運解決方案的市場歷來競爭激烈，但我們相信，與安全產業的下一代和傳統競爭對手相比，我們的雲端原生、單一感測器平台的架構從根本上使我們與眾不同。此外，當我們希望進入鄰近市場並擴大我們的總目標市場時，我們可能會面臨新的競爭對手。然而，我們認為目前沒有任何競爭對手擁有與 Falcon 平台相當的真正平台產品，可以利用該平台贏得傳統市場並定義新類別。"},{"en":"legacy antivirus product providers who offer a broad range of approaches and solutions including traditional signature-based antivirus protection;","zh":""}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Subscription & Circulation","val":4564683000,"zh":"認購及流通"},{"name":"Professional Services","val":247322000,"zh":"專業服務"}],"total":4812005000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":3216654000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":782666000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":495701000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":316984000,"zh":"其他國家"}],"total":4812005000}},"peers":["PANW","SNOW","ZS","NET","CRM"]}}